{"version":1,"content":"<p>由黎諾懿、李佳芯主演馬來西亞外購劇《義和》臨門遭抽起，HOY行政總裁兼執行董事黃雅芬，昨天（20日）出席節目排陣發布會時，直認片商受壓「咩壓力大家都估到」，除失望和金錢損失，大嘆劇集無映期。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T13:41:28.510045+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":95,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T12:56:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T05:57:43.984959+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T13:37:40.747797+00:00","content_hash":"b1d29ac9e0553ada10691b0bbd09ecdb222b5c338e741b03a0183515ef05bc3a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}